Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix: detect gzip NZBs when retry staging renames them

---
 internal/nzbfile/legacy_gzip_test.go | 33 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 internal/nzbfile/nzbfile.go          | 25 ++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
